# Topic ACL — three roles. Everything not granted here is denied.
#
# The one rule that matters most: ONLY `worker` may publish to
# ecandle/+/cmd/# — that is the seller's signing channel (see
# mosquitto.conf header). Devices authenticate by embedding credentials
# in their broker URI (mqtt://device:<pass>@host:1883); esp-mqtt parses
# user:pass from the URI, no firmware change needed.

# ── seller devices ──
user device
topic write ecandle/+/status
topic write ecandle/+/nanopay
topic write ecandle/+/settle
topic write ecandle/+/burn_intent_sig
topic read  ecandle/+/cmd/#

# ── cloud workers (settle-worker + burn-intent-worker) ──
user worker
topic read  ecandle/#
topic write ecandle/+/circle_ack
topic write ecandle/+/mint_ack
topic write ecandle/+/mint_error
topic write ecandle/+/cmd/#

# ── web app (SSE bridge + /api/mint) ──
user web
topic read  ecandle/#
topic write ecandle/mint-queue
